Brodameko Website — Page Inventory
=====================================

App: Brodameko (iOS & Android)
Purpose: Informational website — drives users to download the app

App Features:
  - Find & book professional mechanics
  - Request towing service (GPS-based)
  - Marketplace for car spare parts

Pages:
  1. home.html                    — Hero, app overview, core features, download CTAs
  2. about.html                   — What Brodameko is, the mission, the team
  3. how-it-works.html            — Step-by-step guide for car owners & mechanics
  4. faqs.html                    — Frequently asked questions
  5. contact-us.html              — Contact form and support details
  6. car-owner-join-waitlist.html — Waitlist registration for car owners

App Store Links:
  - Apple App Store: TBC
  - Google Play Store: TBC
